  },
  {
   "configuration_id": "laco_frontier_tvac_36x40_ln2",
   "key": "sample.diameter.max",
   "why": "The page gives only the platen footprint ('approximately 24″ W x 38″ L'). It states no working diameter, clear envelope or vertical clearance. A mounting-plate width is not a maximum sample diameter, and 'approximately' is not a bound. Better encoded as approximate sample.width/length footprint, or left unknown."
  },
  {
   "configuration_id": "laco_frontier_tvac_36x40_ln2",
   "key": "sample.height.max",
   "why": "Wrong key semantics. sample.height.max is 'Maximum sample height / thickness' (vocabulary), but 38 in is the platen LENGTH along the horizontal chamber axis. The page states no vertical clearance above the platen (confirmed on re-fetch)."
  },
  {
   "configuration_id": "laco_frontier_tvac_18x24_ln2_dsub",
   "key": "optical_access",
   "why": "The 6 in door viewport is real, but the configuration also has a 'Door shroud' (Key Features: 'Internal pillow-plated cylindrical shroud and Door shroud'). With LN2 shrouds on the cylinder and the door, the page does not establish that the viewport gives optical access to the test article. Unsure, so rejected."
  }
 ],
